pan>2026年4月13日14:00-5月7日23：59</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>智科体验营一轮申请时间：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>2026年4月13日14:00-6月下旬</span></span></p><p><span><span>具体申请截止时间请关注公众号的后续推送通知</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>点击文末“阅读原文”即可申请</span></span></strong></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/DJUkHEtFudnTdV6Xa1aeZjeZUHrbFUMqb34AibU39EUglV2IKFnHvuFKtEuaKibXGK4Nnl0xH8zSMtjKloDmTTCEQmkd31vRNrUADibap0ZQ2c/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>常见问题</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Q1</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>智科体验营现在可以申请了吗？</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>可以，通过上文链接也可申请智科体验营（DS&amp;BA及QFFE），申请截止为6月下旬，举办时间为7月中上旬，具体时间请关注公众号的后续推送通知。</span><span><strong><span>智科体验营仅有一轮</span></strong></span><span>，请同学们特别留意申请截止时间。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Q2</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>参加不同轮次的体验营对直通领创/智科营有影响吗？</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>不同批次的体验营对直通领创/智科营的人数并没有影响，视参营同学的综合素质而定。根据往年经验，一般前序轮次的直通比例将会比后续轮次高一些，</span><strong><span><span>建议大家在材料准备充分的情况下尽量申请较早批次的体验营。</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Q3</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>管院对于排名有没有硬性规定？排名超20%的同学入不了营？</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>并没有，复旦管院并未对申请者的成绩排名有硬性要求。在审核申请者是否入营时，管院将对申请者所提交的材料进行全面、公平的评估，申请体验营的</span><strong><span><span>必要条件</span></span></strong><span>仅为能够确保获得2026年所在院校推荐免试资格的大三学生，每年实际入营和录取学生的排名和网传的管院“刚性要求”（某些项目甚至网传硬卡10%）差距不小。</span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Q4</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>今年的领创体验营和正式领创营的举办形式有哪些变化？</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>对于体验营同学可以自行选择线上或者线下参与的方式；正式领创营暂定7月-8月中旬举办，采用滚动制的方式线下开展。是否举办九月推免，将视领创营参营同学的综合能力而定。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Q5</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>英语一定要580分以上吗？</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>并不是，</span><strong><span><span>英语书面成绩只是对申请者过往英语能力的证明</span></span></strong><span>，即使是大家认为对英语要求最高的项目，往年也录取过六级成绩（且没有其他英语成绩做补充）远未达到网传最低标准的情况。而对于申请硕博连读项目的同学而言，往年也有低于500分的申请人凭借优秀的综合能力最终拿到录取offer。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Q6</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>可以同时申请专硕项目和硕博项目吗？</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>原则上硕博项目和专硕项目的体验营/夏令营不可同时申请</span></span></strong><span><span>，招生活动互不影响，建议做好充分了解后申请体验营。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sn8E6DplJdDsnS2S3ZBLaQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#复旦管院</a>  <a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sn8E6DplJdDsnS2S3ZBLaQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#领创体验营</a>  <a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sn8E6DplJdDsnS2S3ZBLaQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#智科体验营</a>  <a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sn8E6DplJdDsnS2S3ZBLaQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#保研</a>  <a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sn8E6DplJdDsnS2S3ZBLaQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#MIF</a>  <a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sn8E6DplJdDsnS2S3ZBLaQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#DDIM</a>  <a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sn8E6DplJdDsnS2S3ZBLaQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#GMiM</a> </span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sn8E6DplJdDsnS2S3ZBLaQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#QFFE</a> </span><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/zTVRVjfBSQZVEO4W3xSuOozAmVAicMnTBLyEgWIRolvlXIg4NsHfVeQKAbuDMm1GSjZP0sQspoKVr4XAxjichibzmuySWV2dO7LguEhJY00Cmc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>复旦大学管理学院</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>本硕博教育中心</span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span>电话：021-25011564、25011497</span></p><p><span>邮箱：upec@fudan.edu.cn</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"f4013cf2f151dfc23cf80803a7e25079f08b4cd36f69686337f8f19c47ac7d95","textLength":1164,"sourceSha256":"55da4549778434a407e10236ec7d1960936c09c7857955d100fca2d8e4479b41","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e4c929a12d4f86f0bc23","title":"2026年复旦大学管理学院智科体验营同步开放申请","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:33.681065+00:00"}
